{"message":"I can help coordinate this, but I need to verify your identity before accessing or changing your accounts. Please provide any 2 of the following exactly as they appear on your profile: date of birth, email address, phone number, or mailing address.

After verification, I’ll check your Light Blue Account’s status, balance, pending transactions, opening date, and any applicable $15 early-closure fee. I’ll also confirm your eligibility for a replacement personal checking account and a savings account.

Based on the account information currently available, the highest documented personal savings base rate I found is the Gold Account at 5.5% APY, and your $25,000 would meet its standard $10,000 minimum balance. Any eligible card or relationship bonuses would need to be checked on your profile before determining your effective rate. Please also tell me whether you want the Gold Account, or whether you’d like me to compare the available savings options after verification. For checking, the Bluest Account has premium benefits including 2.25% APY, up to $50 in monthly ATM-fee rebates, 10 complimentary domestic outgoing wires per month, and a dedicated personal banker."}
